# The preview's GENERATED params schemas (tracker/JSON-WIDGET-PLAYGROUND.md
# section 6, U7). The *.params.json files beside them are ORDINARY COMMITTED
# SOURCE -- they are the parameters a fresh clone renders each report with --
# and are deliberately NOT ignored. The preview also writes a self-contained
# .ermine/preview/.gitignore in every workspace folder it uses, which covers
# WP-13/WP-14's *.db as well; this line is the one THIS checkout wants, in
# the place people look.
**/.ermine/preview/**/*.schema.json

# data/ generator (tracker/db/GENERATOR.md): dependencies, build output, generated CSVs
